{"id":"82e0f59361ca6e46","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-bounded-quantifier.md","title":"Bounded Quantifier","display":"df-bounded-quantifier — Bounded Quantifier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-bounded-quantifier","aliases":["88-df-bounded-quantifier"],"display":"df-bounded-quantifier — Bounded Quantifier","depends_on":["[[88-df-formula]]","[[./88-df-term]]","[[88-df-variable]]","[[88-df-free-variable]]","[[88-df-arithmetical-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-bounded-quantifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-bounded-quantifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-quantifier — Bounded Quantifier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ArithForm}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ArithForm}\\)</span> (arithmetic formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> (variable, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> (bound term, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\mathrm{var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\mathrm{var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(t)\\)</span> (the bound is independent of the quantified variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BndData}(x,t,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{BndData}(x,t,\\varphi)\\)</span> (well-formed bounded-quantifier data)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BndData}(x,t,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ArithForm}\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\n\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\n\\land x\\notin\\mathrm{var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(t)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BndData}(x,t,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ArithForm}\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\n\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\n\\land x\\notin\\mathrm{var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(t)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier} \\vdash\n(\\forall x&lt;t)\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,(x&lt;t\\to\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier} \\vdash\n(\\forall x&lt;t)\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,(x&lt;t\\to\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier} \\vdash\n(\\exists x&lt;t)\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,(x&lt;t\\land\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier} \\vdash\n(\\exists x&lt;t)\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,(x&lt;t\\land\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这里的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>是算术签名中的二元关系符号；该缩写不适用于未声明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>的\n任意一阶签名。</li>\n<li>受限量词定义有界公式</li>\n<li>受限量词是有界算术的核心</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BndData}\">\\(\\mathrm{BndData}\\)</span>集中登记句法类型和无自依赖边界条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading"